findings.description:
Effort 3/5 matches the slice plan. The design reuses existing pieces instead of adding parallel ones:
- 422's adapter, with no new protocol (D7);
- 424's runner seam;
- 425's grader and interval;
- 177's judge core, with the per-pair loop extracted rather than copied.

Pairing is limited to the comparisons the ranking uses (D13), roughly half the calls of judging every pair. I found no configuration or abstraction that nothing uses. Every rejection reason has a fixture in the success criteria. The verification walkthrough is long but specific to this slice, and it doesn't restate other documents.
